        <mxCell id="law" value="&lt;b&gt;Law&lt;/b&gt;  Core never references Apps HTTP, Flared, or Playwright.  &lt;b&gt;Same IP&lt;/b&gt;  ProxyUrl on Flared options → solver + StreamBinary handler + Playwright context.  &lt;b&gt;Do not&lt;/b&gt;  embed FlareSolverr in Playwright · spoof WebGL · --disable-gpu · waitUntil=Load on CF." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
